"Bithe is a young Artonan knight in Emban-art'h's squad, with no surname given."
"He has lank brown bangs, tired eyes, an orangish-yellow auriad and a dull red knight coat."
"His knight skill is The Vatha Lantern, asked for stripped of some modernizations."
"Vatha moths come to him whenever he thinks of himself a certain way."
"He snapped at Alden for mangling Artonan, then apologized properly."
"He guarded the bor family at the Here-to-There and ejected Olget-ovekondo from Alden's room."
"He calls Emban and Ryada like family to him."
